hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1019","Hafs bin Amr Al-Biryani told us, Omar bin Ali told us, on the authority of Hisham bin Urwa, on the authority of Anas, on the authority of Aisha, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace. He, peace and blessings be upon him, said: “If one of you breaks the fast while praying, let him put his hand on his nose and leave.”"
